+name: myfolks
+title: MyFolks for Hermes
+repo: https://github.com/fresfrida/myfolks
+sha: 1890207063f11203816a92dff1b23d65a3d182b5
+version: "1.0.0"
+description: "Persistent, exact memory about the people in your life. myfolks, /myfolks or /contacts saves and returns details word for word, with when and where each was saved; saving and recall never call a model. Plain words (remember, fix, forget, undo), a Desktop page to search, add, edit, delete and undo, vCard and CSV import, and optional Google Contacts sync. Encrypted SQLite store (AES-256-GCM) in the Hermes folder. Owner only by default, group chats refused, optional per-person sharing (read or add). Disclosure — no network calls until the owner runs myfolks sync; after that Hermes calls the Google People API (people.googleapis.com, contacts.readonly) for the plugin through its declared oauth client (signed in with hermes auth add myfolks:google, token stored and refreshed by Hermes, never given to the plugin), on each sync and automatically at most every 10 minutes when a save or lookup names someone not yet stored, until myfolks sync off. Replies sent over a messaging platform pass through that platform. AI access is off by default; when turned on, the details it needs are sent to the configured model provider. Hooks: pre_gateway_dispatch answers the owner's (and listed shared people's) MyFolks messages in chat apps before the session sees them; pre_llm_call stops a MyFolks command from reaching the AI; pre_tool_call blocks AI tools that directly name its files. Other messages get an in-memory text check only. Stores its own device key in a file only the user can read, or in the OS keychain when Python's keyring package is available."
+maintainer: fresfrida
+tier: community
+category: tools
+docs_url: https://github.com/fresfrida/myfolks#readme
+requires_hermes: ">=0.23.1"
+image: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fresfrida/myfolks/1890207063f11203816a92dff1b23d65a3d182b5/assets/banner.png
+screenshots:
+  - https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fresfrida/myfolks/1890207063f11203816a92dff1b23d65a3d182b5/assets/phone.png
+  - https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fresfrida/myfolks/1890207063f11203816a92dff1b23d65a3d182b5/assets/didyoumean.png
+  - https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fresfrida/myfolks/1890207063f11203816a92dff1b23d65a3d182b5/assets/desktop-card.png
+  - https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fresfrida/myfolks/1890207063f11203816a92dff1b23d65a3d182b5/assets/hide-from-chat.png
+  - https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fresfrida/myfolks/1890207063f11203816a92dff1b23d65a3d182b5/assets/terminal.png
+known_issues:
+  - "Google sync needs your own Google Cloud OAuth client (Desktop app, People API on), set as MYFOLKS_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID and MYFOLKS_GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET; file import needs nothing."
+  - "Tested in Telegram, the Hermes terminal and Hermes Desktop. Other chat apps and Windows are untested."
+platforms:
+  - macos
+  - linux
+capabilities:
+  provides_tools:
+    - myfolks_contacts
+  provides_hooks:
+    - pre_tool_call
+    - pre_gateway_dispatch
+    - pre_llm_call
+  provides_middleware: []
+  requires_env: []
