+description: "Location reminders that never leave your phone: ask the agent to remind you at a place, and Apple Reminders alerts you when you arrive. The plugin posts a brrr notification whose subtitle is the validated address; an iOS Shortcuts automation turns it into a reminder with a When I Arrive alert, and iOS watches the geofence on-device. Nothing listens on your machine — outbound HTTPS only. Disclosure — each reminder's text and destination address are posted to brrr.now through the user's own BRRR_WEBHOOK_URL and delivered as a push notification; saved place names and addresses are stored in the plugin's data folder."
