+name: zedmode
+repo: https://github.com/latentJake/hermes-zenmode
+sha: 0e6ebbacb1696e49d28181c37ff382ca41b05ec1
+title: Zed Mode
+description: "Every Hermes Desktop conversation in one stack that recedes into the screen, ordered like an inbox: failed, needs you, working, unread, pinned, then the rest. Answer approvals and questions on the card, hold a thread beside the stack, start or branch a chat without leaving, switch a live chat's model, and tune the 3D live. Desktop plugin (desktop/plugin.js inside the plugin SDK surface) plus a read-only dashboard backend that reads the session list from state.db. No network, no credentials, no agent tools, hooks, middleware or env vars. Disclosure — reads every session's titles, prompts and tool-call summaries from state.db read-only for its stack (cache in the profile's plugin-data folder); its Desktop page can send prompts, answer approval and clarify requests you click, rename/branch chats and switch a live chat's model; the backend calls Hermes' private model resolver (`hermes_cli.model_switch.switch_model`) to explain unusable models, which can query your configured provider's model list."
+maintainer: latentJake
+tier: community
+category: desktop
+requires_hermes: ">=0.23.0"
+version: "0.19.0"
+docs_url: https://github.com/latentJake/hermes-zenmode#readme
+image: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/latentJake/hermes-zenmode/0e6ebbacb1696e49d28181c37ff382ca41b05ec1/docs/img/banner.jpg
+screenshots:
+  - https://raw.githubusercontent.com/latentJake/hermes-zenmode/0e6ebbacb1696e49d28181c37ff382ca41b05ec1/docs/img/zedmode-stack.jpg
+  - https://raw.githubusercontent.com/latentJake/hermes-zenmode/0e6ebbacb1696e49d28181c37ff382ca41b05ec1/docs/img/zedmode-hold.jpg
+  - https://raw.githubusercontent.com/latentJake/hermes-zenmode/0e6ebbacb1696e49d28181c37ff382ca41b05ec1/docs/img/zedmode-model-menu.jpg
+  - https://raw.githubusercontent.com/latentJake/hermes-zenmode/0e6ebbacb1696e49d28181c37ff382ca41b05ec1/docs/img/zedmode-new-chat.jpg
+  - https://raw.githubusercontent.com/latentJake/hermes-zenmode/0e6ebbacb1696e49d28181c37ff382ca41b05ec1/docs/img/zedmode-needs-you.jpg
+  - https://raw.githubusercontent.com/latentJake/hermes-zenmode/0e6ebbacb1696e49d28181c37ff382ca41b05ec1/docs/img/zedmode-tune.jpg
